<!-- WHY WORK WITH US -->
<section style="max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 24px 56px;">
  <div class="why-us-card" style="background: #F3F7FB; border-radius: 22px; padding: 48px 56px; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
    <h2 class="why-us-title">Why Work With Us?</h2>
    <div aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; gap: 6px; margin: 16px 0 0;">
      <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E57FB3;"></span>
      <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6FB3E3;"></span>
      <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F5A623;"></span>
      <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F2D91A;"></span>
      <span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8CC63F;"></span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 22px 0 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3C4E68; max-width: 820px;">Locally owned since 2016, WellCare &amp; Nurture brings ABA, occupational, physical and speech therapy together for families across the Pikes Peak region, in their homes and in our clinic. Our team rates us <strong style="color: #1C2F4D;">4.8 stars</strong> for culture, work–life balance and leadership. Collaboration is at the heart of everything we do: our OT, ST, PT and ABA providers work <strong style="color: #1C2F4D;">side by side across disciplines</strong>, sharing insight and coordinating care so every child gets the full support of one connected team. Along the way, you'll grow with dedicated mentorship and continuing education, backed by clinical supervision and a responsive operations team right here in Colorado Springs.</p>
    <a href="#roles" style="margin-top: 30px; text-decoration: none; background: #2E7BC4; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; padding: 14px 40px; border-radius: 999px; min-height: 48px; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; transition: background 0.2s;">Find your role</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OUR CULTURE SECTION -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1100px;">
    <h3 style="margin-top: 1rem; text-align: center; font-size: 2.2rem; color: #1C2F4D; font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;">Our Culture</h3>
    <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0.5rem auto 2.5rem; color: #555; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6;">We celebrate our team through recognition programs, team-building events, and celebrating work anniversaries and milestones. Our multi-disciplinary collaboration means you'll always be learning from colleagues across specialties.</p>

    <div class="culture-gallery">
      {% for photo in culturePhotos.items %}
      <div class="culture-photo {{ photo.size }}">
        <img src="{{ photo.image }}" alt="{{ photo.caption }}">
        <div class="culture-caption">{{ photo.caption }}</div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-size: 2.2rem; color: #1C2F4D;">Ready to Make a Difference?</h2>
      <p style="color: #555; margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">We're always looking for passionate, compassionate professionals to join our team.</p>
      <a href="#roles" class="btn-cta" style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; display: inline-block;">View Open Roles →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
